<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Bradesco H1 net 443.5 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil Bradesco H1 net 443.5 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's largest private bank Bradesco sent the following statement to the stock exchanges on its first half consolidated results.</p>
<p>			   H1 1997</p>
<p>    Shr		 0.47 real</p>
<p>    Net profit	443.5 million</p>
<p>    Net worth     5.725 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation. Share profit per 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>The bank said it showed an annualized return on equity of 16.10 percent.</p>
<p>No comparative figures were provided.</p>
<p>((-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
